            • Most climbers use supplemental oxygen above 7,000m{'\n'}
            • Effective O₂ shows the equivalent oxygen percentage you'd breathe{'\n'}
            • Acclimatization allows the body to partially compensate
          </Text>
        </View>
      </ScrollView>
    </View>
  );
}

